# G2: select the 3D screen (fourth entry, three DOWNs), watch the diffuse cube
# turn, cycle to toon and wobble with SPACE, pause, restart, and leave. Every
# 3D frame is drawn by the device on the emulator and RTL and by the C reference
# natively; the pinned checkpoints hold them to the same pixels.
frame 1 down DOWN
frame 2 up DOWN
frame 2 down DOWN
frame 3 up DOWN
frame 3 down DOWN
frame 4 up DOWN
frame 4 down ENTER
frame 5 up ENTER
frame 8 down SPACE
frame 9 up SPACE
frame 11 down SPACE
frame 12 up SPACE
frame 14 down P
frame 15 up P
frame 16 down P
frame 17 up P
frame 18 down R
frame 19 up R
frame 20 down ESCAPE
frame 21 up ESCAPE
frame 21 down Q
